.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yelin</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Meenan</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Nevitt</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Epstein</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Work disability in rheumatoid arthritis: effects of disease, social, and work factors</article-title><source>Ann Intern Med</source><year>1980</year><volume>93</volume><fpage>551</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7436187</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR6"><label>6.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wilske</surname><given-names>KR</given-names></name><name><surname>Healey</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Remodeling the pyramid&#x02014;a concept whose time has come</article-title><source>J Rheumatol</source><year>1989</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>565</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2754660</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR7"><label>7.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fries</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reevaluating the therapeutic approach to rheumatoid arthritis: the &#x0201c;sawtooth&#x0201d; strategy</article-title><source>J Rheumatol</source><year>1990</year><volume>17</volume><issue>Suppl 22</issue><fpage>12</fpage><lpage>5</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR8"><label>8.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Emery</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Salmon</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Early rheumatoid arthritis: time to aim for remission?</article-title><source>